@startuml
title v1.6 Contextual Bulk Upload
actor User
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Bulk Upload API" as API
participant "Safe ZIP Expander" as ZIP
participant "Versioning Service" as VS
participant "Object Storage" as S3
participant "Ingestion Pipeline" as ING
participant Qdrant
User -> UI: Select files/folder ZIP
UI -> API: multipart files + scoped metadata
API -> API: Authorise content.bulk_upload
API -> ZIP: Inspect/expand ZIP safely
loop each accepted file
API -> VS: Create immutable version
VS -> S3: Store object version
VS --> API: document_version_id
API -> ING: Extract, chunk, embed, index
ING -> Qdrant: Tenant-scoped chunk points
end
API --> UI: Batch, item, version and processing results
UI -> UI: Attach versions to next message
@enduml
